---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Projects & Code"
navKey: projects
permalink: /projects.html
description: "Projects and code by Dinh Xuan Khuong."
---
<div class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">Code &amp; experiments</p><h1>Projects &amp; Code</h1>
  <p class="lead">A collection of repositories, experiments, and things built along the way.</p>
</div>
<section class="split-section">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Selected repositories</p><h2>On the workbench</h2><p class="section-note">Exploring ideas through implementation.</p></div>
  <div class="section-body">
    {% for entry in collections.projects %}
    <article class="paper-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ entry.data.category }}</p>
      <h3><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ entry.data.description }}</p>
      <div class="project-resources">
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ entry.url }}">Read about the project →</a>
        {% if entry.data.repository %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ entry.data.repository }}">[GitHub repository ↗]</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state"><h3>More to come.</h3><p>New projects will appear here.</p></div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="split-section">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Open source</p><h2>More on GitHub</h2></div>
  <div class="section-body"><p>The rest of my code lives on GitHub.</p><a class="button" href="{{ site.github }}?tab=repositories">Browse repositories ↗</a></div>
</section>
